          <name>PCRel32</name>
          <briefdescription>
<para>A 32-bit PC-relative relocation. </para>
          </briefdescription>
          <detaileddescription>
<para>Represents a data/control flow instruction using PC-relative addressing to a target.</para>
<para>Fixup expression: Fixup &lt;- <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_target" kindref="compound">Target</ref> - Fixup + Addend : int32</para>
<para>Errors:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>The result of the fixup expression must fit into an int32, otherwise an out-of-range error will be returned. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
          </detaileddescription>
        </enumvalue>
        <enumvalue id="namespacellvm_1_1jitlink_1_1i386_1ab5b12c7ab25aac492521ed299ab357d4ae9aae291a294099fd9442fbab0b4d1b0" prot="public">
